    "Gustos: *like, love, hate, want, prefer, need*",
    "Mente: *know, understand, believe, remember, think (= opinar)*",
    "Posesión: *have (= tener), own, belong*",
    "Sentidos: *see, hear, smell, taste*"
   ],
